  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Facility for Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The water sector is characterized by several structural challenges, including low pricing, high risk, and significant capital requirements, which together hinder the private sector investments seen in other sectors. To address these challenges, increased governmental strategies and initiatives, as well as risk-tolerant capital, are needed.

The new Danish Water Facility should provide the institutional set-up for solving the above dual challenge. The Facility therefore aims at addressing water challenges in Africa and enhancing Denmark&#x2019;s impact by also drawing on the knowledge and experience of Danish authorities and utilities, and leveraging the embassies&apos; local market insights.</narrative>
  </description>
